config BR2_PACKAGE_ST
	bool "st (suckless simple terminal)"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_XORG7
	depends on BR2_USE_MMU # fork()
	select BR2_PACKAGE_XLIB_LIBX11
	select BR2_PACKAGE_XLIB_LIBXFT
	select BR2_PACKAGE_FONTCONFIG
	help
	  A terminal emulator that draws with Xft and nothing else.

	  It exists here to replace xterm, whose Athena dependency chain -
	  xterm, libXaw7, libXt, libXmu, libXpm, libncursesw, libICE, libSM -
	  totals 1,957,904 bytes and does not fit in the XIP flash image. That
	  chain therefore paged off the SD card on every window redraw, which is
	  what made dragging a window laggy.

	  st needs only libX11, libXft, fontconfig and freetype, all of which
	  are already in the flash image for the server, so it costs roughly
	  100 kB and executes in place.

	  https://st.suckless.org/
